---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="S2a · Real Property Report sample" description="Building and fence positions relative to property lines, setback compliance check — in progress.">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Project S2a · Property survey drafting</p>
      <h1>Real Property Report (RPR) sample</h1>
      <p class="lede">A fictitious residential parcel, built on a real lot shape but with no real address, showing building and
        accessory-structure positions relative to the property lines, distances, and an encroachment / setback compliance check.</p>
      <span class="status planned">In progress</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Planned deliverables</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>Parcel boundary and dimensions, buildings and accessories (garage, fence, deck) located relative to the boundary</li>
    <li>Setback compliance table checked against the applicable Land Use Bylaw</li>
    <li>AI-assisted distance measurement and setback comparison, with an independent QA pass on every automated measurement</li>
    <li>Drawing carrying <code>SAMPLE – FICTITIOUS – NOT FOR LEGAL USE</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Still to confirm before drafting</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>ALSA standard of practice requirements for RPR content and format</li>
    <li>Calgary / Edmonton Land Use Bylaw setback requirements used for the compliance example</li>
  </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
